<DocsLayout title="batze docs — Quick start" description="Try batze in one command with Docker.">
  <h1>Quick start</h1>
  <p>The fastest way to try batze is with Docker. One command and you're running:</p>

  <CodeBlock code="docker run -p 3000:3000 batze/batze" />

  <p>Then open <code>http://localhost:3000</code> in your browser. That's it — you've got a local batze.</p>

  <h2 id="whats-next">What's next</h2>
