    <li>Set it up to stay running in the <a href="/docs/self-hosting">self-hosting guide</a></li>
    <li>Point it at your mailbox and currency in <a href="/docs/configuration">Configuration</a></li>
    <li>Send your first <a href="/docs/invoicing">invoice</a></li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
